    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to believe things can change when the end is so certain. every day is just more of the same—the same smells, the same sounds, the same slow decline. it's like i'm living in a place that's already gone. i look at him and i feel like i'm just waiting for the silence to come so i can finally rest too. does it ever not feel like this? like, is there actually anything beyond this just waiting to happen?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
